itzſtrahl", "conf": 92.5}, {"id": "k039", "baseline": [[70, 1896], [1416, 1896]], "polygon": [[70, 1896], [70, 1911], [1415, 1914], [1416, 1896], [1416, 1866], [70, 1866], [70, 1896]], "box": [66, 1863, 1420, 1917], "region": "_cca4efab-aae3-4a14-ac38-142dcc96a744", "ocr": "erfolgten Brand der früheren Kirche, die übrigens bereits 1617 baufällig war,", "conf": 92.5}, {"id": "k040", "baseline": [[70, 1938], [1418, 1938]], "polygon": [[70, 1938], [70, 1956], [1416, 1959], [1418, 1938], [1418, 1909], [70, 1902], [70, 1938]], "box": [66, 1899, 1422, 1962], "region": "_cca4efab-aae3-4a14-ac38-142dcc96a744", "ocr": "ſchritt die damals einem Wiederaufbau widerſtrebende Gemeinde erſt auf Ein⸗", "conf": 91.8}, {"id": "k041", "baseline": [[70, 1981], [1419, 1981]], "polygon": [[70, 1981], [70, 2001], [1419, 1996], [1419, 1981], [1418, 1948], [70, 1950], [70, 1981]], "box": [66, 1945, 1423, 2004], "region": "_cca4efab-aae3-4a14-ac38-142dcc96a744", "ocr": "wirkung des Landesherrn zum Neubau der jetzigen, 1761 am letzten Trinitat", "conf": 91.6}, {"id": "k042", "baseline": [[69, 2022], [1419, 2025]], "polygon": [[69, 2022], [69, 2043], [531, 2037], [546, 2044], [547, 2044], [549, 2046], [640, 2046], [640, 2044], [705, 2037], [727, 2044], [729, 2044], [730, 2044], [1076, 2038], [1088, 2046], [1089, 2046], [1091, 2046], [1092, 2047], [1242, 2047], [1242, 2046], [1244, 2046], [1260, 2038], [1361, 2038], [1397, 2046], [1398, 2046], [1400, 2046], [1418, 2037], [1419, 2025], [1418, 1993], [69, 1992], [69, 2022]], "box": [65, 1989, 1423, 2050], "region": "_cca4efab-aae3-4a14-ac38-142dcc96a744", "ocr": "eingeweihten Kirche. Sie iſt zwar ohne Denkmale, aber freundlich und licht", "conf": 91.1}, {"id": "k043", "baseline": [[69, 2065], [1416, 2068]], "polygon": [[69, 2065], [69, 2083], [1415, 2083], [1416, 2068], [1413, 2031], [69, 2032], [69, 2065]], "box": [65, 2028, 1420, 2086], "region": "_cca4efab-aae3-4a14-ac38-142dcc96a744", "ocr": "und hat durch einen aus Ullersreuth ſtammenden ſchleizer Bürger, der 125 Thlr.", "conf": 92.4}, {"id": "k044", "baseline": [[67, 2110], [1418, 2110]], "polygon": [[67, 2110], [67, 2127], [1418, 2127], [1418, 2110], [1416, 2076], [67, 2079], [67, 2110]], "box": [63, 2073, 1422, 2130], "region": "_cca4efab-aae3-4a14-ac38-142dcc96a744", "ocr": "legirte, 1863 eine Orgel erhalten. Ihre beiden Glocken mit einerlei Inſchrift", "conf": 91.9}, {"id": "k045", "baseline": [[67, 2152], [1418, 2152]], "polygon": [[67, 2152], [67, 2169], [1416, 2173], [1418, 2152], [1418, 2122], [67, 2121], [67, 2152]], "box": [63, 2118, 1422, 2176], "region": "_cca4efab-aae3-4a14-ac38-142dcc96a744", "ocr": "ſind vom Jahre 1762. Die Kirchengemeinde, deren Vermögen 137½ Thlr.", "conf": 89.5}, {"id": "k046", "baseline": [[69, 2194], [1419, 2194]], "polygon": [[69, 2194], [69, 2214], [1419, 2211], [1419, 2194], [1419, 2164], [69, 2161], [69, 2194]], "box": [65, 2158, 1423, 2217], "region": "_cca4efab-aae3-4a14-ac38-142dcc96a744", "ocr": "beträgt, hat zur Erhaltung der Pfarrgebäude (früher in Gefell, jetzt) in Fröſſen", "conf": 92.7}, {"id": "k047", "baseline": [[66, 2235], [1419, 2238]], "polygon": [[66, 2235], [64, 2254], [1416, 2256], [1419, 2238], [1418, 2203], [66, 2205], [66, 2235]], "box": [60, 2200, 1423, 2259], "region": "_cca4efab-aae3-4a14-ac38-142dcc96a744", "ocr": "beizutragen. Bis Ende des vorigen Jahrhunderts war der Ort auch nach Gefell", "conf": 92.5}, {"id": "k048", "baseline": [[66, 2280], [1415, 2277]], "polygon": [[66, 2280], [66, 2296], [1412, 2299], [1415, 2277], [1410, 2245], [64, 2251], [66, 2280]], "box": [60, 2242, 1419, 2302], "region": "_cca4efab-aae3-4a14-ac38-142dcc96a744", "ocr": "geſchult, gewann aber nun eine Wanderſchule und einen Präceptor, 1825 auf", "conf": 92.2}, {"id": "k049", "baseline": [[66, 2323], [1418, 2323]], "polygon": [[66, 2323], [66, 2346], [1418, 2346], [1418, 2323], [1418, 2293], [66, 2293], [66, 2323]], "box": [62, 2290, 1422, 2349], "region": "_cca4efab-aae3-4a14-ac38-142dcc96a744", "ocr": "Befehl des Landesfürſten einen geſchulten Lehrer mit Winter⸗ und Sommerſchule", "conf": 91.8}, {"id": "k050", "baseline": [[66, 2367], [1416, 2364]], "polygon": [[66, 2367], [66, 2382], [1413, 2383], [1416, 2364], [1413, 2335], [741, 2328], [739, 2328], [738, 2328], [708, 2335], [88, 2329], [87, 2329], [85, 2329], [64, 2335], [66, 2367]], "box": [60, 2325, 1420, 2386], "region": "_cca4efab-aae3-4a14-ac38-142dcc96a744", "ocr": "und endlich 1841 ein eigenes zweckmäßiges Schulhaus. Der Schulkinder ſind", "conf": 92.3}, {"id": "k051", "baseline": [[67, 2406], [1416, 2409]], "polygon": [[67, 2406], [66, 2433], [216, 2445], [217, 2445], [219, 2445], [258, 2436], [349, 2451], [351, 2451], [352, 2451], [391, 2436], [439, 2446], [441, 2446], [525, 2440], [547, 2451], [549, 2451], [550, 2451], [634, 2449], [636, 2449], [672, 2436], [745, 2449], [747, 2449], [748, 2449], [774, 2437], [831, 2452], [833, 2452], [834, 2452], [1007, 2443], [1116, 2452], [1118, 2452], [1119, 2452], [1121, 2452], [1140, 2439], [1154, 2449], [1155, 2449], [1157, 2449], [1158, 2449], [1160, 2449], [1161, 2449], [1182, 2437], [1272, 2437], [1322, 2452], [1323, 2452], [1325, 2454], [1415, 2454], [1416, 2409], [1415, 2380], [67, 2377], [67, 2406]], "box": [62, 2374, 1420, 2457], "region": "_cca4efab-aae3-4a14-ac38-142dcc96a744", "ocr": "44. Im Orte eine Privatſchenke und eine Feuerſpritze. Die weitere Gemeinde", "conf": 90.3}, {"id": "k052", "baseline": [[1182, 2460], [1245, 2452]], "polygon": [[1182, 2460], [1184, 2478], [1247, 2470], [1245, 2452], [1239, 2418], [1178, 2422], [1182, 2460]], "box": [1174, 2415, 1251, 2481], "region": "_cca4efab-aae3-4a14-ac38-142dcc96a744", "ocr": "52²³", "conf": 41.1}], "regions": [{"id": "_cca4efab-aae3-4a14-ac38-142dcc96a744", "type": "text", "polygon": [[1364, 216], [1433, 240], [1427, 2416], [1290, 2434], [1235, 2476], [1176, 2470], [1163, 2440], [1127, 2434], [66, 2422], [72, 246], [1307, 234], [1364, 216]]}, {"id": "_f908067b-1cc1-4558-a5dd-da3dbe3d73d8", "type": "tex